# Pathogen class

## Available data


::: {#tbl-pathogen-counts .cell tbl-cap='Mortality effect sizes by pathogen class (strict pool). Classes with fewer than 3 effect sizes cannot be reliably pooled.'}

```{.r .cell-code .hidden}
#| label: tbl-pathogen-counts
#| tbl-cap: "Mortality effect sizes by pathogen class (strict pool). Classes with fewer than 3 effect sizes cannot be reliably pooled."
es_mort |>
  mutate(pathogen_class = coalesce(pathogen_class, "not reported")) |>
  count(pathogen_class, name = "Effect sizes") |>
  mutate(
    `Pooled?` = if_else(`Effect sizes` >= 3, "Yes", "No — too sparse"),
    pathogen_class = recode(pathogen_class,
      gram_positive  = "Gram-positive",
      gram_negative  = "Gram-negative",
      fungal         = "Fungal",
      mixed          = "Mixed",
      `not reported` = "Not reported"
    )
  ) |>
  arrange(desc(`Effect sizes`)) |>
  rename(`Pathogen class` = pathogen_class) |>
  gt() |>
  tab_style(style = cell_fill(color = "#FEF3CD"),
            locations = cells_body(rows = `Pooled?` == "No — too sparse"))
```

